      "description": {
        "fun": "A tiny dragon that looks like a piece of nigiri sushi and is one of the most intelligent dragon Pokémon. Knowing it's weak, it plays dead to lure in prey, then orders its partner Dondozo to attack, and Tatsugiri will fight among themselves for the right to boss a particular Dondozo. If it can't win, it flees, and even if it's swallowed, it can puff up its throat sac to escape.",
